# =============================================================================
# Fugluck Monorepo Environment Configuration Master Guide
# =============================================================================
#
# Fugluck is a TypeScript monorepo with distinct workspace services:
#
# 1. FRONTEND WEB CLIENT (packages/client -> Vercel)
#    Local: Copy packages/client/.env.example -> packages/client/.env.local
#    Hosted (Vercel): Set in Project Settings -> Environment Variables
#    - VITE_API_URL: Backend server base URL (e.g. https://api-staging.fugluck.com)
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_URL: Supabase client URL (e.g. https://xyz.supabase.co)
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Supabase public anon key (safe for client bundling)
#
# 2. BACKEND API & SOCKET.IO SERVER (packages/server -> Render / Railway)
#    Local: Copy packages/server/.env.example -> packages/server/.env
#    Hosted (Render/Railway): Set in Service -> Environment Variables
#    - DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL connection URI (REQUIRED - isolate staging from production!)
#    - JWT_SECRET: Session token signing secret (REQUIRED - 64+ char random string)
#    - PORT: Server listening port (default: 4000 locally, 10000 or dynamic on host)
#    - NODE_ENV: 'development' | 'production' | 'test'
#    - CLIENT_ORIGIN: Primary client origin (e.g. https://staging.fugluck.com)
#    - ALLOWED_ORIGINS: Comma-separated CORS allowed origins
#    - APP_URL: Base URL for email verification & password reset links
#    - COOKIE_DOMAIN: Cookie domain for cross-subdomain auth (e.g. .fugluck.com)
#    - COOKIE_SAMESITE: Cookie SameSite attribute ('lax' | 'none' | 'strict')
#    - TRUST_PROXY: Reverse proxy trust setting (default: 1)
#    - ENABLE_DEV_DIAMOND_STUB: 'true' | 'false' (Set 'false' in staging/production!)
#    - EMAIL_PROVIDER: 'logger' | 'resend' | 'smtp' (default: logger)
#    - EMAIL_FROM: Sender email display address
#    - RESEND_API_KEY: API key if EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend
#    - SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASS: Credentials if EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp
#    - VERBOSE_LOGGING: 'true' | 'false'
#
